        "excerpt": "Series Document — BODC Document 1762365\nBritish Oceanographic Data Centre\nContact us\nRegister\nLog in\nService status\nHome\nSearch the data\nSubmit your data\nResources\nAbout\nInventories\nSummary of BODC holdings\nCruise inventory\nEDMED\nGLOSS Station Handbook\nNERC Data Catalogue\nMetadata Deposit Conditions\nVocabularies\nNVS search tool\nNVS editor\nNVS vocabulary builder\nBODC parameter codes\nSeaVoX\nDelivery formats\nBODC request (ASCII) format\nOcean Data View (ODV) format\nQXF (a netCDF) format\nCF netCDF format\nAXF (historical) format\nSea level formats\nNTSLF format\nESLD format\nWOCE format\nProducts\nData products\nBODC data products\nCollaborative data products\nExternal data products\nBODC software products\nGEBCO Grid display\nEcho-Sounding Correction Tables\nQXF2MAT function\nBODC Web Services\nNERC Vocabulary Server\nMarsden Square translator\nGEBCO Web Map Service (WMS)\nHelp and hints\nUsing this web site\nAccessibility\nCopyright\nDisclaimer\nPicture copyrights\nPrivacy and cookies\nService status\nSite styles\nSoftware updates\nErrata\nFAQ\nPortals and links\nSea level portal\nMEDIN\nSeaDataNet\nEMODnet\nEnvironmental Data Service\nGEOTRACES\nMERMAN\nSearch\nSubmission templates\nData planning\nData deposit conditions\nProject proposals\nEarly in your project\nLater in your project\nSubmission guidelines\nGeneral guide\nPreferred file formats\nCurrent meter data\nMoored ADCP data\nMoored instrument data\nSea level data\nCTD data\nWater sample data\nBiological data\nXBT data\nShipborne ADCP data\nUnderway data\nModel data\nTowed undulator data\nDrifting buoy/float data\nData citation and DOIs\nLevel of service\nDataset selection procedures\nModification and versioning\nWhat do we do with your data?\nData processing steps\nDatabase design\nBODC database\nAll data series\nCTD profiles\nCurrent meter series\nGlider inventory\nSamples data\nWave data series\nHosted data systems\nSea level\nUK Tide Gauge Network\nHistorical