ore\n1733742\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-24 04:56Z\n24° 54' S, 25° 4' W\nClick for more\n1733754\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-24 13:56Z\n26° 30' S, 25° 2' W\nClick for more\n1733766\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-25 05:12Z\n28° 48' S, 25° 27' W\nClick for more\n1733778\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-25 14:16Z\n29° 24' S, 26° 12' W\nClick for more\n1733791\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-26 14:09Z\n30° 56' S, 28° 5' W\nClick for more\n1733809\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-27 05:06Z\n32° 23' S, 29° 51' W\nClick for more\n1733810\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-27 14:00Z\n33° 19' S, 31° 4' W\nClick for more\n1733822\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-28 06:00Z\n35° 19' S, 33° 39' W\nClick for more\n1733834\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-28 14:57Z\n36° 21' S, 34° 58' W\nClick for more\n1733846\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-29 05:57Z\n38° 28' S, 37° 45' W\nClick for more\n1733858\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-29 14:57Z\n39° 52' S, 39° 39' W\nClick for more\n1733871\nCTD/STD cast\n2015-10-30 06:01Z\n41° 40' S, 42° 13' W\nClick for more\n1733883\nCTD/STD cast\n2",
